	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "maya-admin-panel-api-consolidated",
		"name": "Maya Admin Panel - Consolidated API Collection",
		"description": "Consolidated comprehensive collection of all Maya Platform Admin APIs (120+ endpoints)\n\n## 🚀 CONSOLIDATED & UPDATED!\nThis collection reflects the consolidated admin user management:\n- ✅ Removed duplicate user_management endpoints\n- ✅ Consolidated admin user management under /admin-users\n- ✅ All functionality preserved in single module\n- ✅ Realistic request bodies and examples\n- ✅ Pre-configured environment variables\n- ✅ Authentication flow with token management\n\n## Features Included:\n- 🔐 Authentication (5 endpoints)\n- 👥 Consolidated Admin User Management (15 endpoints)\n- 📅 Booking Management (7 endpoints)\n- 💳 Payment Management (10 endpoints)\n- ⭐ Review Management (7 endpoints)\n- 🎨 Artist Verification (6 endpoints)\n- 🚀 Promotions & Marketing (12 endpoints)\n- 🎧 Support Management (15 endpoints)\n- 📊 Analytics & Reports (8 endpoints)\n- ⚙️ System Configuration (17 endpoints)\n- 🏢 Business Management (12 endpoints)\n- 👤 Customer Management (8 endpoints)\n- 🏪 Provider Management (7 endpoints)\n- 💰 Financial Management (22 endpoints)\n\n## Consolidation Changes:\n- Removed duplicate /users/* endpoints\n- All admin user management now under /admin-users/*\n- Added dashboard stats to admin user management\n- Consolidated session and activity endpoints\n- Preserved all functionality in single module\n\n## Quick Start:\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Run 'Admin Login' to authenticate\n3. Use /admin-users/* endpoints for admin user management\n\n## All Variables Pre-Configured:\n- Server URL, credentials, and sample IDs included\n- Realistic test data in request bodies\n- No external files or database setup needed",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "maya-admin-collection-consolidated"
	},
